"1985-aime-10": { s: String.raw`How many of the first $1000$ positive integers can be expressed in the form $$\lfloor2x\rfloor+\lfloor4x\rfloor+\lfloor6x\rfloor+\lfloor8x\rfloor,$$ where $x$ is a real number, and $\lfloor z\rfloor$ denotes the greatest integer less than or equal to $z?$`, u: "https://live.poshenloh.com/past-contests/aime/1985" },
