"1985-aime-5": { s: String.raw`A sequence of integers $a_1,$ $a_2,$ $a_3,$ $\ldots$ is chosen so that $a_n=a_{n-1}-a_{n-2}$ for each $n\geq3.$ What is the sum of the first $2001$ terms of this sequence if the sum of the first $1492$ terms is $1985,$ and the sum of the first $1985$ terms is $1492?$`, u: "https://live.poshenloh.com/past-contests/aime/1985" },
